  "prefLabel": "Sphc 102.10 Rental or selling of hearing aids",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 102.10 “Rental or selling of hearing aids” means “rental or selling of hearing aids” as defined by RSA 326-F:1, IX, namely, “the selection, adaptation, and sale or rental of hearing aids. Also included is the making of impressions for ear molds and instruction pertaining to the use of hearing aids;”.\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25",
